1
00:00:00,673 --> 00:00:03,513
(Howard:)...you have to get the head
of the decorating committee too?

2
00:00:04,010 --> 00:00:07,350
(Leonard:)-What are you talking about?
-Look, don't play innocent with me.

3
00:00:07,514 --> 00:00:12,224
(Howard:)I practically invented using
fancy lab equipment to seduce women.

4
00:00:12,852 --> 00:00:17,692
(Leonard:)-Has it ever worked?
-Not so far, but that's not the point.

5
00:00:17,857 --> 00:00:20,397
(Leonard:)Howard, relax.
I am not interested in your girlfriend.

6
00:00:20,568 --> 00:00:24,658
(Howard:)I hope not,
because you don't wanna mess with me.

7
00:00:29,953 --> 00:00:32,033
(Howard:)I'm crazy.

8
00:00:34,040 --> 00:00:35,920
(Leonard:)I believe you.

9
00:00:37,710 --> 00:00:39,880
SHELDON:
Research journal, entry one.

10
00:00:40,046 --> 00:00:44,886
(Sheldon:)I'm about to embark on one of the great
challenges of my scientific career:

11
00:00:45,718 --> 00:00:48,218
(Sheldon:)teaching Penny physics.

12
00:00:49,389 --> 00:00:52,929
(Sheldon:)I'm calling it Project Gorilla.

13
00:00:54,477 --> 00:00:57,267
(Penny(knocking and entering):)-Hey, Sheldon.
-Come in. Take a seat.

14
00:00:58,439 --> 00:01:00,689
(Sheldon:)Subject has arrived.

